 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The sequence of thesis, argument and justification",
     "texto": [
      "In a persuasive essay or editorial in the cultivated press, the statement of a thesis (**These**) must be immediately supported by probative arguments (**Argumente**) and justifying data introduced by causal and illative connectors (**da, denn, folglich, somit**): **Der Ausbau des Schienennetzes ist unverzichtbar, da er die Emissionen nachhaltig senkt** (The expansion of the rail network is indispensable, since it reduces emissions in a sustainable way)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Emphasis and grounding of viewpoints",
     "texto": [
      "To reinforce the hierarchy of the reasoning, formulas of critical judgement are used: **Es lässt sich nicht bestreiten, dass …** (It cannot be denied that…) and **Als ausschlaggebender Faktor erweist sich …** (As the decisive factor it proves to be…)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Level of discourse",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Connector or formula",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Example in opinion columns",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
      [
       {
        "texto": "Initial thesis",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Ich trete dafür ein, dass …",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Ich trete für Reformen ein.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "Causal justification",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "da + final subordinate clause / since",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Da die Ressourcen knapp sind, …",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "Logical deduction",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "folglich / somit + V2",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Somit steigen die Chancen.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ]
     ],
